### Gradle ###
# This project does NOT use Gradle. Tests, Checkstyle, and inspections are all
# run through the JetBrains MCP server against the plain JAVA_MODULE, so there
# is no second build system to keep in sync. These rules are kept only so that
# if a build is ever reintroduced it cannot reach students by accident.
.gradle/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/
build.gradle
settings.gradle
gradlew
gradlew.bat
gradle/

